                <pb facs="0774" n="676" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg676"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hunter to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic">April 26,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hunter reports having discussed the Pears matter with the chargé d’affaires
                    of Honduras, who, after advising his Government, suggests arbitration, and asks
                    if such a proposition should be entertained.)</p>
            </div>
